b06re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "1", "image": "engenn8le14ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: So, we're here to plan our event. Shouldn't you be taking notes, Peter?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I am, actually. So ... isn't the idea to integrate corporate social responsibility into this new business model just a way of attracting more consumers?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Yes and no. It might attract new customers, but research suggests current customers respond better when companies do charity work.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: If they support the company, they ought to be loyal and willing to spend more. But above all, the company ought to comply with ethical standards and develop a sense of responsibility toward the community. Shouldn't contributing to educational and social programs be the whole point of doing this?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Yes."}, {"time": "42500", "image": "engenn8le14ob06re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Okay. Wouldn't it be better if we focused mainly on the event? We'd better set a date. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Haven't we decided on one already? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: We have for the external launch. Don't you think we should set a date to launch the rebranding internally? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: That's a good idea. We might want to do it internally prior to an external launch. That way we can troubleshoot any problems that may arise.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: How about a speaker? Can't we have Rocco as the main speaker?"}, {"time": "71000", "image": "engenn8le14ob06re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: I've already checked with him and he's available. You might want to include Farmani as well. It's his company. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Right. That ought to be discussed. Maybe a short intro and a few lines. Didn't the venue manager call to confirm availability?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes. We can check that off the list. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: I have confirmed the budget and contacted the press. We're good to go! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Excellent!"}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio"}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}